WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.100 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 7=

01:47.940 --> 01:48.830
(Jiangcheng Educated Youth Office)

01:48.830 --> 01:51.026
I was going to tell him about it
in the next few days.

01:52.010 --> 01:53.630
That's great.

01:53.860 --> 01:55.340
I knew it.

01:55.340 --> 01:57.700
Jiangcheng No. 1
Textile Factory is a huge organization.

01:57.900 --> 02:00.080
I'm sure you guys
are very responsible.

02:00.620 --> 02:02.640
Let me thank you on the hero's behalf.

02:03.170 --> 02:04.010
Don't mention it.

02:04.010 --> 02:05.220
We're just doing our duty.

02:06.430 --> 02:07.500
Alright.

02:09.370 --> 02:10.080
Did you hear that?

02:10.120 --> 02:10.970
I did.

02:10.970 --> 02:12.490
Ms. Xu said yes herself.

02:12.930 --> 02:13.440
As for you,

02:13.620 --> 02:15.180
you should head back and wait patiently.

02:15.410 --> 02:16.410
Thank you, Mr. Gao.

02:22.410 --> 02:23.570
Feng, what's wrong?

02:23.782 --> 02:24.900
You're so careless today.

02:24.970 --> 02:26.090
Sorry, Ms. Xu.

02:26.090 --> 02:27.090
I was careless.

02:28.471 --> 02:30.004
Alright now. You may resume your work.

02:30.930 --> 02:31.450
Mom.

02:31.604 --> 02:32.960
Don't call me that in the office.

02:34.337 --> 02:35.900
I want to request something from you.

02:36.426 --> 02:38.604
I want to take Fei Ni home
for lunch this weekend.

02:43.570 --> 02:45.970
Don't discuss
personal affairs in the office.

02:46.810 --> 02:47.900
Is it a yes or a no?

02:53.570 --> 02:54.030
Fine.

02:55.390 --> 02:56.140
Take her home.

02:57.370 --> 02:57.970
Really?

03:00.220 --> 03:01.060
If I must say,

03:01.060 --> 03:02.530
Ms. Xu, you do have great awareness.

03:02.582 --> 03:04.315
You sorted out
your thoughts in an instant.

03:04.690 --> 03:07.090
Mom, prepare some of
your signature dishes this weekend.

03:07.090 --> 03:08.000
Fei Ni loves fish.

03:08.000 --> 03:08.720
Remember that.

03:25.370 --> 03:27.550
This shampoo does
make our hair smell great.

03:28.560 --> 03:30.820
Ni, this is your first time
visiting their family.

03:31.090 --> 03:32.060
You must be courteous.

03:34.300 --> 03:35.820
Ni.

03:35.870 --> 03:36.370
Wait.

03:36.370 --> 03:36.930
Come here.

03:36.930 --> 03:37.530
All done.

03:37.530 --> 03:38.460
Here's your bag.

03:41.410 --> 03:42.020
Ni,

03:42.620 --> 03:44.090
take these tea leaves

03:44.330 --> 03:45.450
and these cans

03:46.120 --> 03:46.740
with you.

03:47.160 --> 03:49.060
I think Ye Feng's mother will like them.

03:49.293 --> 03:51.530
Dad, no need for that.
Just keep them for yourself.

03:51.850 --> 03:54.370
It's fine. I'm fine with
drinking the crumbs.

03:54.460 --> 03:57.240
I requested my friend to buy them.

03:57.315 --> 03:58.970
It's your first time
visiting his family.

03:59.110 --> 03:59.530
Yes.

03:59.780 --> 04:01.690
I know we aren't
as well-off as they are.

04:01.780 --> 04:03.626
But we can't just embarrass
ourselves, you know?

04:03.804 --> 04:04.900
There's no need for this.

04:04.900 --> 04:05.290
Mom...

04:05.290 --> 04:06.960
It's fine. Just listen to me.

04:07.000 --> 04:08.937
It's your first time
visiting their family.

04:08.937 --> 04:10.300
We mustn't let them belittle us.

04:10.300 --> 04:10.760
Precisely.

04:10.760 --> 04:11.160
Am I right?

04:11.160 --> 04:12.090
- Take them.
- Here.

04:12.370 --> 04:12.900
Here.

04:12.900 --> 04:13.850
Just listen to me, okay?

04:15.300 --> 04:15.750
Alright.

04:16.330 --> 04:17.320
I'll be going now.

04:17.940 --> 04:18.430
Go now.

04:21.510 --> 04:22.220
I'll be going now.

04:22.337 --> 04:23.604
You guys should remain here.

04:26.940 --> 04:27.410
Dear,

04:28.570 --> 04:31.250
don't you think things
are progressing too quickly for Ni?

04:31.250 --> 04:32.180
How is it quick?

04:32.182 --> 04:34.871
You wanted to sleep with me
the second day you knew me, you know?

04:41.620 --> 04:45.460
(Unite and Achieve Greater Victory!)

04:51.210 --> 04:51.910
Fei Ni.

04:52.540 --> 04:53.500
Let me help you out.

04:54.915 --> 04:55.626
Be careful.

04:55.760 --> 04:57.370
It's already good enough
that you're here.

04:57.370 --> 04:58.937
No need to bring all these things.

05:00.248 --> 05:01.150
When you go upstairs,

05:01.150 --> 05:02.420
don't be nervous, okay?

05:02.450 --> 05:03.270
You see,

05:03.270 --> 05:04.960
although my mother might look strict

05:04.960 --> 05:06.129
when she's in the factory,

05:06.130 --> 05:07.890
she's completely different
when she's home.

05:09.120 --> 05:09.840
Besides,

05:10.180 --> 05:10.980
I'm here too.

05:11.100 --> 05:11.690
Okay.

05:11.760 --> 05:12.730
I'm not nervous at all.

05:13.180 --> 05:13.900
Great.

05:15.500 --> 05:16.360
Here are your keys.

05:16.500 --> 05:16.940
Let's go.

05:21.330 --> 05:21.810
Come.

05:27.330 --> 05:28.790
Mom.

05:28.940 --> 05:29.760
Fei Ni is here.

05:30.250 --> 05:31.450
Why are you shouting?

05:31.790 --> 05:33.180
You have no manners at all.

05:35.848 --> 05:36.390
Go inside.

05:37.540 --> 05:38.370
Fei Ni is here.

05:38.890 --> 05:40.180
Hello, Ms. Xu.

05:41.370 --> 05:41.790
Hello.

05:43.860 --> 05:44.350
Mom,

05:44.620 --> 05:46.180
Fei Ni bought these especially for you.

05:46.180 --> 05:47.570
We have top-grade tea leaves,

05:47.570 --> 05:48.420
canned yellow peaches

05:48.420 --> 05:50.160
in malted milk syrup, and so on.

05:52.160 --> 05:53.300
Leave them on the table.

05:54.382 --> 05:55.782
Don't just stand there. Have a seat.

05:55.810 --> 05:56.330
Here.

06:06.500 --> 06:07.090
Here.

06:08.093 --> 06:08.890
Have some water.

06:09.360 --> 06:09.860
Thank you.

06:10.810 --> 06:11.390
How is it?

06:11.560 --> 06:12.960
My place is pretty okay, isn't it?

06:13.540 --> 06:13.980
Yeah.

06:15.150 --> 06:15.890
Oh yeah, Mom,

06:16.110 --> 06:17.420
are the dishes ready?

06:17.450 --> 06:18.270
Let's eat.

06:18.770 --> 06:19.620
Wait a little longer.

06:20.530 --> 06:21.890
Another guest is coming.

06:22.250 --> 06:23.020
Another guest?

06:23.204 --> 06:24.480
Isn't our guest already here?

06:34.100 --> 06:34.680
Who's there?

06:36.560 --> 06:37.410
Hi, Ms. Xu.

06:37.810 --> 06:38.320
Ling!

06:38.320 --> 06:39.730
Please come inside.

06:39.860 --> 06:40.940
We were waiting for you.

06:41.420 --> 06:42.060
Ms. Xu,

06:42.690 --> 06:44.770
I've brought you two excellent
revolutionary novels.

06:46.370 --> 06:47.100
Mom, this...

06:47.100 --> 06:48.990
"Sparkling Red Star",

06:50.060 --> 06:51.680
and "Song of Ideals", huh?

06:52.060 --> 06:53.340
Just look!

06:53.860 --> 06:56.450
All of her gifts serve
to nourish our spirits!

06:57.080 --> 06:58.160
Unlike some individuals

06:58.480 --> 07:00.100
who only buy food and stuff.

07:02.040 --> 07:03.130
The trip is quite long.

07:03.130 --> 07:04.120
You must be sweating.

07:04.660 --> 07:05.970
Let me make you some tea.

07:07.980 --> 07:08.440
Here.

07:09.950 --> 07:11.030
Thank you, Ms. Xu.

07:11.030 --> 07:13.450
Don't call me that when we're at home.

07:14.890 --> 07:16.440
Call me Mrs. Ye.

07:17.200 --> 07:18.330
Thank you, Mrs. Ye.

07:19.300 --> 07:20.090
Ye Feng,

07:20.182 --> 07:21.440
why are you still sitting there?

07:21.690 --> 07:22.500
Head to the kitchen.

07:22.500 --> 07:23.620
I was washing some lychees.

07:23.620 --> 07:24.715
Hurry and bring them here.

07:25.620 --> 07:26.000
Okay.

07:35.660 --> 07:37.300
Fresh lychees are the best.

07:38.810 --> 07:39.890
I'm allergic to lychees.

07:41.071 --> 07:43.271
Wait, are people
actually allergic to lychees?

07:45.180 --> 07:46.640
I'll pass it to them, then.

07:47.760 --> 07:48.810
You guys can enjoy them.

07:50.570 --> 07:51.060
Here.

07:51.640 --> 07:52.400
Ling Yi.

07:54.570 --> 07:55.370
This is a huge one.

07:56.500 --> 07:57.280
Thank you, Mrs. Ye.

07:57.660 --> 07:58.570
You're welcome.

08:02.370 --> 08:03.210
You're welcome.

08:03.210 --> 08:03.915
Have some water.

08:10.540 --> 08:11.280
Fei Ni.

08:12.200 --> 08:13.370
I heard from Ye Feng

08:13.920 --> 08:15.130
that you love fish.

08:15.940 --> 08:16.430
Yeah.

08:17.970 --> 08:19.250
I bought one especially for you.

08:20.400 --> 08:21.010
Look.

08:21.520 --> 08:23.100
Isn't my mom nice to you?

08:24.480 --> 08:25.650
Please go and prepare it.

08:29.010 --> 08:29.490
Mom,

08:29.693 --> 08:30.910
that's inappropriate of you.

08:31.620 --> 08:33.610
Coincidentally,
Ling Yi loves fish as well.

08:34.680 --> 08:35.340
Why don't we have

08:35.540 --> 08:36.660
braised fish for dinner?

08:37.380 --> 08:38.210
Mrs. Ye, that's fine.

08:38.210 --> 08:38.850
Okay.

08:38.915 --> 08:40.090
We'll do braised fish, then.

08:40.420 --> 08:41.210
Mom!

08:41.293 --> 08:42.450
The kitchen is over there.

08:44.690 --> 08:45.280
Okay.

08:56.260 --> 08:58.060
Fei Ni, I'm truly sorry about this.

08:58.060 --> 08:59.730
I didn't know that Ling Yi
would be coming.

08:59.737 --> 09:01.404
My mom didn't tell me
about it beforehand.

09:11.810 --> 09:12.900
But, think about it...

09:13.350 --> 09:15.490
My mom is a sharp person.

09:15.660 --> 09:16.740
You're a part of the family

09:16.740 --> 09:17.660
while Ling Yi is a guest.

09:17.660 --> 09:19.360
That's why she allowed you
to use our kitchen.

09:21.610 --> 09:23.090
Doesn't that prove

09:23.293 --> 09:25.250
that she has accepted you
as her daughter-in-law?

09:31.520 --> 09:32.290
I'm fine.

09:32.760 --> 09:33.848
I understand the situation.

09:34.570 --> 09:35.450
I'm not mad either.

09:35.782 --> 09:36.760
I'm glad to hear that.

09:36.900 --> 09:37.250
Here,

09:37.337 --> 09:38.090
let me help you.

09:38.690 --> 09:40.370
Ye Feng, what are you doing?

09:40.820 --> 09:42.720
Come and entertain our guest.

09:48.490 --> 09:49.600
You should go.

09:49.890 --> 09:50.490
After all,

09:50.490 --> 09:51.480
Ling Yi is your guest.

09:53.250 --> 09:54.700
Alright, I'll head there first.

09:54.730 --> 09:56.137
I'll come back and help you later.

09:58.100 --> 09:58.890
What's wrong?

10:06.380 --> 10:06.960
Here,

10:07.490 --> 10:08.180
have some fish.

10:08.250 --> 10:09.180
Thank you, Mrs. Ye.

10:09.600 --> 10:10.310
Here, Fei Ni.

10:10.537 --> 10:11.350
Have some fish, too.

10:15.220 --> 10:16.420
Don't stand on ceremony.

10:16.700 --> 10:19.460
Just make yourself at home, okay?

10:21.300 --> 10:22.490
Here, have some vegetables.

10:24.010 --> 10:24.580
Ye Feng,

10:25.580 --> 10:27.600
hurry and offer Ling Yi a toast.

10:27.804 --> 10:30.471
She spent a lot of effort
just to write that article, you know?

10:31.700 --> 10:32.240
Mom,

10:32.740 --> 10:34.700
it was just a short article.

10:34.770 --> 10:36.530
Even Fei Ni could
write something like that.

10:36.530 --> 10:37.630
Fei Ni, what about this?

10:38.250 --> 10:40.100
Write an article for us tomorrow.

10:40.220 --> 10:42.340
Paste it on
the factory's bulletin board.

10:43.010 --> 10:44.130
How could they be the same?

10:44.730 --> 10:47.530
Only the best of the best
could enroll in college, you know?

10:48.340 --> 10:49.080
Just look at her.

10:49.420 --> 10:51.600
She gives off a different air.

10:56.180 --> 10:58.220
I don't see
anything different about her.

10:58.980 --> 10:59.870
Besides,

10:59.937 --> 11:01.960
so what if she manages
to enroll in college?

11:02.180 --> 11:03.120
It's more honorable

11:03.160 --> 11:04.560
to be one of the working class.

11:05.100 --> 11:07.250
Do you know how many people
are scrambling to get in?

11:07.530 --> 11:09.530
That was because
she hadn't figured it out yet.

11:09.530 --> 11:11.470
Serving one's husband
and educating one's children

11:11.471 --> 11:12.700
are what a woman should do.

11:13.250 --> 11:14.370
They try to enroll in college

11:14.370 --> 11:15.693
in order to get a good job

11:15.737 --> 11:18.250
so that they can get married
to a good husband, right?

11:18.820 --> 11:20.220
Fei Ni, once you get married to me,

11:20.220 --> 11:21.370
I'll buy you all the books

11:21.370 --> 11:22.250
you want to read.

11:22.271 --> 11:24.848
Why would she need to go to college
if she could have all this?

11:24.870 --> 11:26.715
She wouldn't even attend it.
Am I right, Fei Ni?

11:26.715 --> 11:27.804
Here. Have some vegetables.

11:28.530 --> 11:29.470
In my opinion,

11:29.850 --> 11:31.320
women should still enroll in colleges.

11:32.890 --> 11:36.060
Undergraduates are cultured
and well-educated.

11:36.060 --> 11:36.650
Mom,

11:37.420 --> 11:38.890
didn't you tell me

11:39.130 --> 11:41.910
that you would let
Fei Ni marry into our family

11:42.380 --> 11:44.130
as long as she didn't attend college?

11:44.730 --> 11:45.540
But why are you

11:45.820 --> 11:46.890
praising undergraduates

11:46.890 --> 11:48.340
nonstop right now?

11:49.730 --> 11:51.060
The two of them are different.

11:51.060 --> 11:52.340
How are they different?

11:52.700 --> 11:54.010
I heard from Ms. Liu

11:54.250 --> 11:56.220
that Fei Ni could play the piano.

11:56.530 --> 11:57.250
Fei Ni,

11:57.770 --> 12:00.420
although we don't have a piano here,

12:00.730 --> 12:02.010
we have an accordion.

12:02.060 --> 12:04.300
The one where you have
to pull it and play it vertically.

12:04.300 --> 12:05.700
I think it's the same as a piano.

12:07.890 --> 12:08.660
Not at all.

12:11.150 --> 12:11.920
Mrs. Ye,

12:12.250 --> 12:13.520
I know how to play the accordion.

12:13.890 --> 12:16.130
Why don't I perform a song for you all?

12:18.180 --> 12:19.700
Sure.

13:10.060 --> 13:10.750
Ms. Xu,

13:11.060 --> 13:11.890
I'm done.

13:11.890 --> 13:13.204
You guys can enjoy your meal.

13:20.650 --> 13:22.340
I suppose you won't be using

13:22.340 --> 13:23.610
all the things I brought.

13:23.610 --> 13:24.850
I'll take them with me as well.

13:27.300 --> 13:27.890
Fei Ni?

13:30.100 --> 13:30.730
Fei Ni?

13:35.060 --> 13:36.750
She has no manners at all.

13:38.100 --> 13:39.820
She finished the entire fish

13:39.820 --> 13:41.350
by herself!

13:41.760 --> 13:43.680
I don't know what
Ye Feng likes about her.

13:44.530 --> 13:46.130
Fei Ni, why are you mad?

13:47.890 --> 13:48.610
Fei Ni?

13:49.130 --> 13:49.750
Ye Feng.

13:50.848 --> 13:52.940
What if I say I won't let you
play basketball again?

13:52.940 --> 13:54.026
Will you be happy with that?

13:54.048 --> 13:55.010
Of course not.

13:55.420 --> 13:57.130
Playing basketball is my career now.

13:57.130 --> 13:58.650
It's a dream I had since I was a child.

13:58.650 --> 14:00.340
Enrolling in college
is my dream as well.

14:00.340 --> 14:02.310
Since you're not willing
to give up on your dream,

14:02.315 --> 14:03.648
why should I give up on mine?

14:04.600 --> 14:05.520
Fei Ni,

14:06.130 --> 14:07.730
so what if you enroll in college?

14:08.093 --> 14:10.300
Can you find someone
with a better background than me?

14:10.770 --> 14:11.900
Right now, our priority

14:12.130 --> 14:13.850
is to get into a relationship

14:13.850 --> 14:15.360
and get married as soon as possible.

14:17.620 --> 14:18.580
You should head back.

14:20.160 --> 14:21.890
I can't just head back alone.

14:21.890 --> 14:22.700
I can't face my mom.

14:22.737 --> 14:23.530
What about this?

14:23.650 --> 14:25.400
Apologize to my mom.

14:25.410 --> 14:27.940
You won't be able to face your mom
if you bring me with you now.

14:27.940 --> 14:29.848
It's obvious that your mom sees Ling Yi

14:29.871 --> 14:31.300
as her future daughter-in-law.

14:31.300 --> 14:33.800
Her attitude doesn't
represent mine, you know?

14:35.890 --> 14:36.430
Fine.

14:36.448 --> 14:37.650
Let me ask you this, then.

14:37.660 --> 14:39.630
What if your mom disagrees
with our relationship?

14:40.340 --> 14:41.460
I'll try to persuade her.

14:50.180 --> 14:50.960
Ye Feng,

14:51.710 --> 14:52.690
I think we need

14:53.130 --> 14:54.700
to reconsider this.

14:57.510 --> 14:58.740
Reconsider what?

15:00.250 --> 15:01.300
We don't suit each other.

15:04.530 --> 15:05.270
Fei Ni,

15:05.460 --> 15:06.820
what makes you say that?

15:07.120 --> 15:08.200
Don't be angry.

15:08.337 --> 15:10.130
I can persuade my mom
to change her mind.

15:11.890 --> 15:12.460
Fei Ni.

15:16.820 --> 15:17.360
Fei Ni?

15:17.610 --> 15:18.340
Don't worry!

15:18.340 --> 15:19.410
Mom always listens to me!

15:28.020 --> 15:31.780
(Inpatient)

15:46.060 --> 15:46.600
Fei Ni.

15:47.871 --> 15:49.300
You're finally here to visit me.

15:50.610 --> 15:52.100
I'm here to deliver something to you.

15:59.610 --> 16:00.370
Sorry about that,

16:00.370 --> 16:01.060
Ye Feng.

16:02.330 --> 16:04.200
Ms. Xu just told me
to join her for lunch.

16:04.200 --> 16:06.137
I didn't know
that your girlfriend would be here.

16:06.530 --> 16:08.340
Was she upset?

16:10.080 --> 16:10.820
Why don't I

16:11.240 --> 16:12.530
seek her out

16:12.530 --> 16:13.980
and explain things on your behalf?

16:14.337 --> 16:15.060
No need for that.

16:15.370 --> 16:16.940
Fei Ni isn't that petty.

16:17.580 --> 16:18.360
Besides,

16:18.650 --> 16:20.130
she's upset because of my mom,

16:20.130 --> 16:21.130
not you.

16:22.130 --> 16:24.420
Since when did you
get together with Fei Ni?

16:25.130 --> 16:26.300
Not that long ago.

16:26.650 --> 16:27.130
We...

16:30.610 --> 16:31.530
Comrade Ling Yi.

16:32.010 --> 16:33.130
You see, my mom

16:33.220 --> 16:35.130
loves to play matchmaker.

16:35.250 --> 16:36.940
But I'm a man with my own convictions.

16:36.940 --> 16:38.010
I have a girlfriend.

16:38.093 --> 16:40.300
You should know
what I'm trying to get at here.

16:43.460 --> 16:44.530
I understand.

16:44.530 --> 16:45.530
Don't misunderstand me.

16:45.730 --> 16:47.130
I just

16:47.700 --> 16:49.220
admire you a little.

16:49.770 --> 16:50.510
Admire me?

16:51.420 --> 16:52.240
For what?

16:54.160 --> 16:55.280
I admire you

16:57.730 --> 16:59.130
for being a great basketball player.

17:02.404 --> 17:03.610
You're right about that.

17:04.140 --> 17:07.010
When it comes to basketball,
I'm one of the top players

17:07.180 --> 17:08.840
in the municipal league.

17:09.320 --> 17:09.940
What about this?

17:09.940 --> 17:12.620
Just tell me beforehand
if you want to spectate the matches.

17:12.750 --> 17:14.026
I'll reserve a good seat for you.

17:14.490 --> 17:15.140
Sure.

17:15.460 --> 17:17.290
Alright, I won't see you off, then.

17:17.290 --> 17:18.090
Take care.

17:18.090 --> 17:19.048
I'll head back first.

17:19.140 --> 17:19.460
Okay.

17:30.050 --> 17:31.220
She was picking on you.

17:33.220 --> 17:35.010
Not entirely.

17:35.250 --> 17:36.290
I understand her feelings.

17:36.900 --> 17:39.430
To Ms. Xu,
I'm not good enough for Ye Feng.

17:39.430 --> 17:41.360
Ye Feng is the one
who isn't good enough for you.

17:41.460 --> 17:42.560
That's not the main point.

17:42.860 --> 17:45.170
The main point is, I feel sorry for us.

17:45.293 --> 17:46.250
Do you know something?

17:46.290 --> 17:47.770
Last time, when Ye Feng visited us,

17:47.770 --> 17:49.620
my parents went to borrow
some braised beef.

17:49.620 --> 17:50.860
My dad is a glutton.

17:50.860 --> 17:52.380
Even so, he didn't take a single bite.

17:52.380 --> 17:53.660
He gave Ye Feng all of it.

17:53.660 --> 17:54.900
When I was at Ye Feng's house,

17:54.900 --> 17:56.700
I tried my best to devour the fish.

17:56.700 --> 17:58.290
But fish isn't as expensive as beef.

17:58.290 --> 17:59.900
I couldn't get my money's worth.

17:59.900 --> 18:01.460
It would've been a major loss for us

18:01.460 --> 18:02.620
had I not brought these back.

18:03.730 --> 18:05.050
Remember to have them.

18:05.180 --> 18:06.190
They're good stuff.

18:06.770 --> 18:07.160
Okay.

18:08.730 --> 18:09.220
By the way,

18:10.226 --> 18:11.940
I have two pieces of good news for you.

18:13.620 --> 18:14.190
Firstly,

18:14.770 --> 18:15.590
I got myself a job.

18:16.620 --> 18:17.220
Really?

18:17.220 --> 18:19.490
Yeah. I'll be drawing comic strips
for a magazine firm.

18:19.537 --> 18:21.150
I need to undergo
two months of training,

18:21.182 --> 18:23.004
but I'll get subsidized
during that period.

18:23.420 --> 18:24.670
That's great.

18:24.980 --> 18:27.050
Two months aren't that long.

18:27.060 --> 18:28.490
You have to do well in your training.

18:28.490 --> 18:29.250
Do not slack off.

18:29.250 --> 18:30.290
Alright. I won't slack off.

18:31.537 --> 18:32.650
Just look at me. Before this,

18:32.860 --> 18:33.910
I was seriously wounded.

18:34.071 --> 18:35.570
Now, not only have I fully recovered,

18:35.580 --> 18:37.115
but I also managed to find myself a job.

18:37.290 --> 18:38.810
Therefore, certain things take time.

18:39.048 --> 18:40.900
We'll find a way to resolve
our issues eventually.

18:41.460 --> 18:42.340
It's the same for you.

18:42.380 --> 18:43.460
You mustn't be impatient.

18:43.493 --> 18:44.600
Never settle for less.

18:44.620 --> 18:46.469
Go on more
blind dates before getting married.

18:46.470 --> 18:48.270
You should go on
as many blind dates as you can.

18:48.271 --> 18:50.260
After that,
compare all of the candidates. You'll...

18:50.260 --> 18:51.570
If so, I don't think

18:51.570 --> 18:53.380
I'll ever get married.

18:57.560 --> 18:59.180
What's the second piece of good news?

18:59.900 --> 19:00.430
Secondly,

19:00.871 --> 19:02.582
the textile factory you're working at

19:02.604 --> 19:04.248
agreed to give me a separate unit.

19:06.290 --> 19:07.980
This is great.

19:08.420 --> 19:10.050
That means you can settle down now.

19:10.050 --> 19:11.250
When will you move there?

19:11.293 --> 19:13.048
I think I still have
to wait for some time.

19:13.071 --> 19:15.420
Until your factory
finishes assigning all the new dorms

19:15.420 --> 19:16.620
and vacates the old ones

19:16.940 --> 19:17.690
before it's my turn.

19:18.180 --> 19:19.490
That's already good enough.

19:19.770 --> 19:21.840
I was afraid that they might
go back on their word.

19:21.960 --> 19:23.626
I suppose they still have a conscience.

19:27.290 --> 19:27.680
Fei Ni,

19:29.050 --> 19:29.880
once I get the unit,

19:30.493 --> 19:31.715
you should come and stay.

19:34.140 --> 19:35.090
That won't do.

19:35.330 --> 19:36.980
How could I stay with you?

19:36.990 --> 19:39.010
I mean, I'll let you stay there
for the time being.

19:39.026 --> 19:40.460
You're in a rush to move out, right?

19:40.860 --> 19:42.460
I'm a man. I can survive anywhere.

19:42.471 --> 19:44.293
At most, I'll just sleep
in the magazine firm.

19:44.420 --> 19:45.460
This won't do either.

19:45.648 --> 19:46.900
That definitely won't do.

19:47.570 --> 19:50.290
The unit is yours. You managed
to earn it by risking your life.

19:50.290 --> 19:51.570
How could I monopolize it?

19:52.660 --> 19:53.810
How are you monopolizing it?

19:53.871 --> 19:55.982
I'm just going to let you
stay there for now.

19:56.050 --> 19:57.050
At most,

19:57.826 --> 19:59.382
I'll charge you some rent.

20:01.180 --> 20:01.730
No.

20:02.490 --> 20:03.010
Okay.

20:05.570 --> 20:06.410
But I know.

20:06.471 --> 20:07.937
You're just trying to help me out.

20:08.380 --> 20:09.180
Thanks for that.

20:11.290 --> 20:12.050
I'll be going now.

20:12.490 --> 20:12.850
Okay.

20:16.900 --> 20:17.700
I'll remember.

20:19.460 --> 20:20.700
Remember to finish them.

20:20.700 --> 20:21.130
Okay.

20:29.770 --> 20:30.770
Remember, okay?

20:47.560 --> 20:49.309
There's a good reason why ancient people

20:49.310 --> 20:51.240
enjoyed climbing high places
to gaze into the distance.

20:51.250 --> 20:52.290
When I stand here,

20:52.700 --> 20:54.050
it feels like all of my worries

20:54.420 --> 20:56.660
will melt away amidst the gorgeous view.

20:58.700 --> 21:00.860
One of the most deceptive functions
of the human brain

21:01.010 --> 21:02.460
is its knack for creating illusions.

21:04.010 --> 21:06.220
But I usually describe it
as avoiding reality.

21:17.220 --> 21:18.290
You sound like

21:18.290 --> 21:20.170
a neurosurgeon now.

21:23.620 --> 21:24.050
Sometimes,

21:24.050 --> 21:25.940
avoiding reality isn't
necessarily a bad thing.

21:27.071 --> 21:28.900
We should take
a break sometimes, you know?

21:37.220 --> 21:39.010
I hear your research focus is on

21:39.226 --> 21:40.350
computational mathematics.

21:41.404 --> 21:43.290
Did you inquire about me
from Professor Wu?

21:44.820 --> 21:46.290
Why not pure mathematics?

21:46.820 --> 21:48.420
I've heard you've won the gold medal

21:48.426 --> 21:51.700
in the Jiangcheng Math Competition
more than once.

21:52.960 --> 21:54.515
You did inquire a lot about me, huh?

21:54.648 --> 21:56.448
That's the most basic information

21:56.490 --> 21:58.320
one can find out if we wish
to understand them.

22:01.460 --> 22:02.290
My mom...

22:05.010 --> 22:05.680
She said

22:07.010 --> 22:08.080
plenty of people can handle

22:08.080 --> 22:09.180
dull theoretical research.

22:09.980 --> 22:11.340
What the country needs right now

22:11.340 --> 22:13.360
is the development
of computational mathematics.

22:13.460 --> 22:15.582
I should devote myself
to the most meaningful task.

22:16.010 --> 22:16.980
Most importantly,

22:17.271 --> 22:18.471
I like the subject.

22:21.900 --> 22:22.570
I understand.

22:30.900 --> 22:32.040
May I ask you a question?

22:33.770 --> 22:34.900
What if I say no?

22:35.315 --> 22:36.400
Will you stop asking me?

22:41.250 --> 22:42.770
This question is very important to me.

22:46.700 --> 22:48.090
Have you truly drawn the line

22:48.810 --> 22:49.830
with your parents

22:50.700 --> 22:51.670
and your family?

23:02.715 --> 23:04.050
My father's last name is Fang.

23:04.093 --> 23:05.380
My mother's last name is Mu.

23:06.460 --> 23:07.900
That's how I got my name.

23:08.700 --> 23:10.570
How can I draw a line with them?

23:11.048 --> 23:12.660
My parents have made mistakes.

23:13.150 --> 23:14.860
Even so, they've never let me down.

23:16.900 --> 23:18.900
My younger brother didn't
draw a line with them.

23:19.010 --> 23:20.980
Did that stop him from being a hero?

23:33.160 --> 23:34.715
It's getting windy out here.

23:35.050 --> 23:35.920
Let's head back first.

23:52.380 --> 23:55.900
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

23:57.190 --> 24:00.040
Feng, don't give yourself
too much emotional burden.

24:00.960 --> 24:03.040
Mr. Gao of
the Educated Youth Office called us

24:03.040 --> 24:05.090
to discuss the issue with
Comrade Fang Muyang.

24:05.380 --> 24:06.290
You heard it as well.

24:07.130 --> 24:09.330
After the discussion our higher-ups had,

24:10.220 --> 24:12.050
you were the only single person

24:12.426 --> 24:14.240
on the organization's
new unit name list.

24:15.380 --> 24:15.900
Therefore...

24:15.900 --> 24:16.460
Ms. Xu.

24:17.900 --> 24:19.700
Fang Muyang is a hero
who saved other people.

24:19.980 --> 24:21.900
He deserved to have a unit
allocated to him.

24:22.290 --> 24:24.010
No matter what,

24:24.220 --> 24:25.770
I should give him the unit.

24:26.250 --> 24:27.050
Feng,

24:27.120 --> 24:30.010
I admire you for your intelligence,
your ability to pick up things fast,

24:30.010 --> 24:31.090
and your awareness.

24:31.770 --> 24:32.770
Keep up the good work.

24:32.937 --> 24:34.604
You'll definitely become the backbone

24:34.604 --> 24:35.810
of our factory in the future.

24:35.810 --> 24:36.700
Thank you, Ms. Xu.

24:38.090 --> 24:38.820
Good job.

24:39.360 --> 24:40.900
Ms. Xu, I'll return to work first.

24:40.900 --> 24:41.700
Alright, go ahead.

24:50.050 --> 24:50.860
Ms. Xu.

24:51.700 --> 24:53.090
There are certain things

24:53.530 --> 24:55.290
that I don't know if I should tell you.

24:55.770 --> 24:56.530
What is it?

24:56.730 --> 24:57.570
Tell me.

24:58.180 --> 24:59.050
Tell me about it.

24:59.050 --> 25:00.180
Don't hesitate.

25:02.660 --> 25:04.250
I'm just a little worried.

25:07.180 --> 25:08.770
Will the hero, Fang Muyang,

25:09.570 --> 25:10.730
have a negative impact on you

25:11.620 --> 25:13.290
in the future?

25:14.900 --> 25:16.380
What are you saying?

25:17.448 --> 25:18.871
You see, there's something off

25:19.620 --> 25:20.730
about his conduct.

25:22.700 --> 25:23.510
Feng,

25:24.090 --> 25:25.380
you mustn't spout such nonsense.

25:25.860 --> 25:27.050
That's a heinous offense.

25:27.660 --> 25:28.700
I didn't make this up.

25:29.071 --> 25:31.293
Our comrades in the factory
all witnessed it themselves.

25:32.570 --> 25:33.090
Fang Muyang

25:33.337 --> 25:35.620
heads over to the factory
to find Fei Ni every other day.

25:36.220 --> 25:37.240
But everyone knows

25:37.570 --> 25:38.660
that Fei Ni and Ye Feng

25:39.380 --> 25:40.560
are dating each other now.

25:41.460 --> 25:42.640
And, just a few days ago,

25:43.204 --> 25:45.048
I even saw Fang Muyang and Fei Ni alone

25:45.420 --> 25:47.800
at the bottom of their unit.

25:48.900 --> 25:50.070
They were so close.

25:50.760 --> 25:53.093
Fei Ni even tied
Fang Muyang's shoelaces for him.

25:53.448 --> 25:55.290
I would've thought
that they were a couple

25:55.570 --> 25:57.710
had I not known any better.

26:02.700 --> 26:03.900
Even so, that doesn't prove

26:03.900 --> 26:06.470
that Comrade Fang Muyang's conduct
is problematic.

26:07.515 --> 26:10.250
After all, he hasn't fully recovered
from his brain damage yet.

26:10.810 --> 26:11.760
We cannot hold him

26:11.860 --> 26:13.900
to the same standards
as ordinary people.

26:15.770 --> 26:16.500
Indeed.

26:18.290 --> 26:19.160
But you see,

26:19.810 --> 26:21.280
he knew how to seek out

26:21.671 --> 26:23.620
the Educated Youth Office
and Mr. Gao's help

26:23.648 --> 26:25.804
to get him a unit even before
he had fully recovered.

26:26.460 --> 26:28.050
If he's fully recovered,

26:29.010 --> 26:30.980
he might do something worse.

26:34.290 --> 26:35.220
Don't forget,

26:35.710 --> 26:36.860
Fang Muyang deceived you

26:37.180 --> 26:38.860
by pretending to be fully recovered.

26:40.420 --> 26:41.430
Let's drop the fact

26:41.804 --> 26:44.271
that there might be something
between Fei Ni and Fang Muyang.

26:44.620 --> 26:46.160
But he places so much trust in Fei Ni.

26:48.700 --> 26:49.680
I'm just worried

26:49.715 --> 26:51.490
that if you allocate
the unit to him today,

26:51.560 --> 26:53.471
he'll demand something else
in the future.

26:53.515 --> 26:55.010
If so, we'll be at a disadvantage.

26:58.050 --> 26:59.200
And, in the future,

26:59.530 --> 27:01.110
if you want him to do something for you,

27:02.080 --> 27:03.770
you and he won't be on the same page.

27:05.700 --> 27:07.460
It's more than just about the unit.

27:10.570 --> 27:11.170
But Ms. Xu,

27:12.050 --> 27:12.860
I'm different.

27:13.760 --> 27:15.620
I was personally promoted
and nurtured by you.

27:16.220 --> 27:18.050
I'll definitely side with you.

27:19.900 --> 27:21.110
And, most importantly,

27:22.810 --> 27:23.690
once Fang Muyang

27:23.860 --> 27:25.460
joins our dorm,

27:26.570 --> 27:28.570
he'll be one of us.

27:30.770 --> 27:31.680
He's the hero

27:31.860 --> 27:33.700
whom you nurtured personally.

27:34.810 --> 27:35.800
But in the future,

27:36.490 --> 27:37.930
if he does something detrimental

27:38.570 --> 27:40.080
under someone else's command,

27:41.090 --> 27:43.290
your reputation is the one
that'll be affected.

27:50.850 --> 27:51.370
Come.

27:52.250 --> 27:53.480
Hurry! Block him!

27:53.880 --> 27:54.770
Spread out!

27:57.182 --> 27:59.700
Spread out the defensive baseline!
Don't leave anyone open!

28:06.650 --> 28:07.660
Ask for the ball.

28:08.382 --> 28:09.460
Pull the line outward.

28:12.204 --> 28:13.220
Here, ask for the ball.

28:14.790 --> 28:15.330
Breakthrough.

28:16.330 --> 28:17.290
Are you saying

28:17.560 --> 28:19.648
that you've allocated
my unit to someone else?

28:20.010 --> 28:21.090
So now, I have no unit?

28:21.530 --> 28:22.800
Comrade Fang Muyang,

28:23.404 --> 28:25.530
it's not that I've allocated
your unit to someone else.

28:25.860 --> 28:27.680
You just have to
wait for the next batch.

28:27.940 --> 28:29.500
But you already promised me last time.

28:29.604 --> 28:31.330
Why don't we discuss this
with Mr. Gao, then?

28:32.570 --> 28:33.810
I did promise you before.

28:34.460 --> 28:36.140
But according to our higher-ups,

28:36.140 --> 28:38.730
since the name list for
the current batch has been confirmed,

28:39.090 --> 28:40.530
we shouldn't alter it for no reason.

28:40.770 --> 28:41.430
If not,

28:41.770 --> 28:43.660
it can easily lead to other issues.

28:43.980 --> 28:45.330
Other issues? What issues?

28:46.330 --> 28:47.700
Whose instruction was this?

28:48.600 --> 28:49.960
What kind of attitude is that?

28:50.693 --> 28:51.980
Are you interrogating me now?

28:55.290 --> 28:55.900
That's not it.

28:55.900 --> 28:56.700
Ms. Xu,

28:56.915 --> 28:59.293
you know that my brain
hasn't been functioning well

28:59.420 --> 29:00.110
after

29:00.660 --> 29:01.550
I was injured.

29:02.293 --> 29:03.860
That's why I spoke without thinking.

29:06.530 --> 29:08.060
You're a hero.

29:08.380 --> 29:09.400
You're a role model.

29:09.530 --> 29:12.730
You're someone everyone
should aspire to be.

29:12.804 --> 29:14.050
What does a role model do?

29:14.570 --> 29:16.320
A role model should
uphold their principles

29:16.770 --> 29:19.900
and place the interests
of the people above all else.

29:20.048 --> 29:22.160
For example, the unit allocation
for the current batch.

29:22.160 --> 29:23.160
You should

29:23.410 --> 29:26.230
meet the needs of ordinary workers

29:26.426 --> 29:28.404
and carry forward
the spirit of Lei Feng.

29:28.980 --> 29:29.700
What do you say?

29:33.004 --> 29:34.090
If so, do you have a unit?

29:34.530 --> 29:35.510
I do.

29:35.980 --> 29:38.050
Why don't you uphold your principles

29:38.271 --> 29:39.770
and follow the example of Lei Feng

29:40.115 --> 29:41.804
by giving other people your unit, then?

29:43.530 --> 29:45.460
Stop messing around here.

29:45.700 --> 29:47.280
Our factory's unit allocation policy

29:47.280 --> 29:49.810
prioritizes
married employees with families.

29:49.810 --> 29:52.160
Nothing will change unless you give me
your wedding certificate

29:52.182 --> 29:53.093
by tomorrow!

30:01.110 --> 30:01.670
Fei Ni.

30:12.010 --> 30:12.940
Are you still upset?

30:14.980 --> 30:15.730
Ye Feng,

30:16.090 --> 30:17.140
I've given it some thought.

30:17.730 --> 30:19.140
We don't suit each other.

30:19.530 --> 30:20.410
Just look at you.

30:21.090 --> 30:21.890
I told you already.

30:22.180 --> 30:23.640
My mom always listens to me.

30:23.810 --> 30:24.860
Stop your nonsense, okay?

30:25.140 --> 30:27.420
Ms. Xu isn't the main issue here.

30:28.671 --> 30:30.115
Let me ask you something.

30:30.660 --> 30:31.940
If we do get married,

30:31.960 --> 30:34.490
and I still insist on enrolling
in college, will you support me?

30:35.010 --> 30:36.340
Fei Ni, that's enough of you.

30:41.460 --> 30:43.980
I already begged my mom
to give your brother a job.

30:44.570 --> 30:46.440
I already argued
with my mom because of you.

30:46.440 --> 30:48.660
I've rejected Ling Yi as well.
What else do you want?

30:49.150 --> 30:50.180
What's going on over there?

30:51.050 --> 30:52.410
Isn't that Fei Ni and the captain?

30:52.640 --> 30:54.080
Are they having an argument?

30:55.860 --> 30:57.920
Did I say something earlier

30:59.010 --> 31:00.140
that gave you the wrong idea?

31:00.570 --> 31:03.230
I've never requested you to get a job

31:03.380 --> 31:04.330
for my brother.

31:06.730 --> 31:07.940
I'm not good enough for you.

31:08.071 --> 31:09.320
You can find someone better.

31:09.604 --> 31:11.760
Since you know
you're not good enough for me,

31:11.804 --> 31:13.893
don't you think you should
treat my mom and me better?

31:13.960 --> 31:16.140
That day, you left my house
after throwing a tantrum.

31:16.226 --> 31:18.660
I didn't say anything about it.
I even apologized to you.

31:18.860 --> 31:19.730
But look at you.

31:20.810 --> 31:21.430
Fei Ni,

31:21.582 --> 31:23.330
don't you think
you should be more sensible?

31:23.330 --> 31:24.115
That's precisely why

31:24.330 --> 31:26.250
you should find someone
who's more sensible,

31:26.250 --> 31:27.330
who's obedient to you,

31:28.250 --> 31:29.250
and who your mom likes.

31:33.540 --> 31:34.860
Clarify yourself.

31:34.860 --> 31:35.620
Ye Feng, let go.

31:35.620 --> 31:36.700
Clarify yourself!

31:36.700 --> 31:37.320
Let go!

31:37.320 --> 31:38.626
- Clarify yourself!
- Let go!

31:43.700 --> 31:45.020
What are you doing here again?

31:50.660 --> 31:51.460
Fang Muyang?

31:52.004 --> 31:53.180
What are you doing here?

31:54.360 --> 31:55.490
I'll tell you about it later.

31:55.810 --> 31:56.700
Comrade Fang Muyang,

31:57.050 --> 31:58.100
Fei Ni is my girlfriend.

31:58.290 --> 32:00.390
You'll affect her reputation
if you keep finding her,

32:00.404 --> 32:00.915
you know?

32:01.180 --> 32:02.030
I don't.

32:02.980 --> 32:03.600
Did you forget?

32:04.140 --> 32:05.090
My brain is damaged.

32:05.730 --> 32:06.990
Just now, I heard Fei Ni saying

32:07.337 --> 32:08.730
that you two don't suit each other.

32:10.337 --> 32:11.715
Did you forget about that too?

32:13.770 --> 32:14.090
Come.

32:17.140 --> 32:17.600
Fei Ni,

32:19.180 --> 32:19.700
hop on.

32:20.980 --> 32:21.730
How dare you?

32:27.750 --> 32:29.380
If you dare to get on his bike,

32:29.980 --> 32:31.730
I'll stop helping
your brother get a job.

32:32.737 --> 32:34.380
Even if you wish to enroll in college,

32:35.530 --> 32:37.090
you still need my mother's permission.

32:40.230 --> 32:41.350
Get on my bike.

33:09.980 --> 33:11.960
Fei Ni, you'd better not regret this!

33:19.330 --> 33:20.460
What are you guys staring at?

33:20.648 --> 33:22.080
- Why did you guys stop?
- Let's go.

33:22.250 --> 33:23.490
Keep playing!

33:45.380 --> 33:46.140
I'll send you home.

33:47.090 --> 33:48.420
I don't feel like going home now.

33:52.730 --> 33:54.570
(I'll stop helping
your brother to get a job.)

33:54.693 --> 33:56.360
(Even if you wish to enroll in college,)

33:56.530 --> 33:58.090
you still need my mother's permission.

33:58.700 --> 34:02.010
(Undergraduates are cultured
and well-educated.)

34:02.220 --> 34:03.570
(The two of them are different.)

34:03.570 --> 34:04.560
He refused to come back

34:04.570 --> 34:06.980
because he was afraid you might
have no place to stay after his return.

34:06.980 --> 34:07.810
I promise.

34:07.810 --> 34:09.940
I'll make him come back
and marry you in three months.

34:20.210 --> 34:22.690
Don't be upset. I'll take you somewhere.

34:51.050 --> 34:51.860
What's on your mind?

34:56.940 --> 34:58.130
Actually,

34:58.900 --> 35:01.300
I've never considered
marriage seriously.

35:01.980 --> 35:03.040
In my opinion,

35:03.820 --> 35:05.270
if I have to get married eventually,

35:05.270 --> 35:06.750
it's better for me to get married now.

35:06.780 --> 35:08.582
At least I can help resolve
the housing issue

35:08.626 --> 35:09.780
for my brother and Lin Mei.

35:10.293 --> 35:11.980
But after that, I realized I was wrong.

35:12.780 --> 35:15.190
I thought getting married
was so much easier.

35:16.170 --> 35:18.260
I thought I was already
mentally prepared.

35:18.380 --> 35:19.000
But I realized

35:19.000 --> 35:20.080
that I still couldn't accept

35:20.080 --> 35:21.570
an unequal relationship.

35:23.570 --> 35:26.570
Perhaps love
doesn't exist in my marriage.

35:26.940 --> 35:27.490
However,

35:28.340 --> 35:29.380
respect is a must.

35:32.380 --> 35:33.170
You're right.

35:39.260 --> 35:40.900
Why did you go to the factory today?

35:42.980 --> 35:44.300
Xu Hongqi told me to come.

35:45.170 --> 35:46.030
She told me

35:46.226 --> 35:48.093
that the unit she promised
to allocate to me

35:49.090 --> 35:49.740
was gone.

35:51.530 --> 35:52.230
But why?

35:52.560 --> 35:54.671
Because there's only
a limited number of units.

35:55.460 --> 35:56.330
Xu Hongqi said

35:56.448 --> 35:59.026
that they had to prioritize
married workers with a family.

35:59.515 --> 36:00.604
But I won't give up.

36:00.626 --> 36:02.093
If they don't allocate it to me today,

36:02.100 --> 36:03.839
I'll head to
the Educated Youth Office tomorrow.

36:03.840 --> 36:05.490
I'm going to bring
a reporter with me as well.

36:05.493 --> 36:08.310
I'll interview her and ask her if it's
appropriate to let a hero like me

36:08.448 --> 36:09.848
stay hospitalized all this while.

36:15.050 --> 36:15.980
Fang Muyang,

36:17.530 --> 36:19.440
why do you desire a unit that much?

36:20.570 --> 36:21.660
You told me this yourself.

36:22.248 --> 36:24.448
You said I shouldn't stay
in the hospital for too long.

36:24.980 --> 36:26.520
If not, I'll fall sick for no reason.

36:29.900 --> 36:32.130
I have a solution
to resolve your housing issue.

36:32.530 --> 36:33.160
What is it?

36:34.490 --> 36:35.570
Let's get married.

36:48.260 --> 36:49.090
Don't panic.

36:49.460 --> 36:50.110
It's fake.

36:51.170 --> 36:51.940
I mean,

36:51.940 --> 36:53.920
are you willing to stage
a fake marriage with me?

36:54.050 --> 36:55.420
Let me tell you the situation.

36:55.610 --> 36:57.050
Since Ms. Xu said

36:57.140 --> 37:00.260
the units are only allocated to
married workers with a family,

37:00.260 --> 37:01.560
if we get married,

37:01.648 --> 37:03.115
that means she has no excuses

37:03.610 --> 37:05.980
to not allocate any units to you.

37:08.340 --> 37:09.380
Although

37:09.380 --> 37:10.700
the marriage certificate is real,

37:10.740 --> 37:11.790
the marriage is fake.

37:12.780 --> 37:14.780
Do you understand?

37:20.570 --> 37:21.040
I do.

37:22.570 --> 37:23.570
But don't you think

37:23.782 --> 37:25.490
this is too much of a sacrifice for you?

37:26.050 --> 37:28.000
I have my own plans too.

37:28.260 --> 37:29.940
You know my situation as well.

37:30.490 --> 37:32.370
Therefore, when we get married,

37:32.780 --> 37:34.050
you'll receive your unit.

37:34.340 --> 37:35.190
And, half of the unit

37:35.420 --> 37:36.580
should be mine.

37:36.893 --> 37:37.915
Is that okay with you?

37:38.780 --> 37:39.390
Yeah.

37:42.740 --> 37:44.170
When should we register our marriage?

37:49.300 --> 37:49.950
Have you

37:50.420 --> 37:51.940
recovered your memory?

37:56.690 --> 37:57.980
I remember you told me

37:58.470 --> 37:59.570
that you liked me a lot.

37:59.626 --> 38:01.404
You said that no one liked me
as much as you.

38:01.404 --> 38:02.804
That's why I never forgot about it.

38:02.804 --> 38:03.480
That's nonsense.

38:03.480 --> 38:04.570
I never said that before.

38:04.570 --> 38:05.360
If you don't like me,

38:05.370 --> 38:07.130
why did you come to the hospital
to take care of me?

38:07.130 --> 38:09.582
Those are two different matters.
I went to take care of you

38:09.604 --> 38:11.130
because I wanted to enroll in college.

38:11.130 --> 38:12.050
Don't make it

38:12.050 --> 38:13.090
sound so trivial.

38:13.740 --> 38:15.570
If so, when did you start liking me?

38:15.570 --> 38:17.239
I've never liked you.

38:17.240 --> 38:18.940
If so, why are you trying
to marry me?

38:18.940 --> 38:20.170
It's because of the unit.

38:20.170 --> 38:21.340
You need the unit too.

38:21.340 --> 38:22.940
The unit will be split equally among us.

38:23.090 --> 38:24.090
Why is that the case?

38:24.160 --> 38:25.530
Your parents live together, right?

38:25.530 --> 38:26.860
Because they love each other.

38:26.860 --> 38:28.050
We're doing it to get a unit.

38:28.050 --> 38:29.090
Can't we do both?

38:29.090 --> 38:29.900
No.

38:31.860 --> 38:32.860
If we get married,

38:33.170 --> 38:34.420
I'll own half of it.

38:35.210 --> 38:35.550
Okay.

38:37.648 --> 38:38.804
Whatever you say.

38:42.570 --> 38:44.920
There's one more important condition.

38:45.404 --> 38:47.260
I won't stop you
from enrolling in college.

38:48.300 --> 38:48.990
On the contrary,

38:50.490 --> 38:51.750
I'll do my best to support you.

39:00.170 --> 39:01.120
Thank you.

39:23.260 --> 39:24.980
Why are you staring at me?

39:26.026 --> 39:28.210
How would you know if you weren't
staring at me yourself?

39:29.260 --> 39:32.170
I suppose this is how you stare
at the nurses usually, huh?

39:33.340 --> 39:34.210
Are you upset?

39:34.570 --> 39:35.510
No.

39:36.340 --> 39:37.860
I did it because I had to draw them.

39:37.940 --> 39:39.426
I had no choice but to observe them.

39:39.530 --> 39:41.000
I think you were trying to draw them

39:41.000 --> 39:42.530
because you wanted to observe them.

39:43.940 --> 39:45.260
That's an interesting take.

39:45.260 --> 39:47.300
This is just a reminder.

39:47.337 --> 39:49.382
No matter if you're
drawing a portrait or so on,

39:49.404 --> 39:50.610
if you keep staring at girls,

39:50.715 --> 39:52.340
people will complain about your conduct.

39:52.340 --> 39:53.380
You should be more careful.

39:54.340 --> 39:55.570
Once we get married,

39:55.980 --> 39:57.540
you'll be the only girl I draw.

39:57.737 --> 39:59.210
That way, no matter how I draw you,

39:59.248 --> 40:00.690
people won't complain about my conduct.

40:00.693 --> 40:01.804
No need for that.

40:01.980 --> 40:03.380
You can draw whoever you like.

40:03.490 --> 40:04.671
It's none of my business.

40:12.260 --> 40:12.880
Come on.

40:13.380 --> 40:14.460
I'll send you home.

40:16.900 --> 40:17.690
Hop on.

40:20.620 --> 40:26.540
♪If the future cannot be grasped♪

40:28.460 --> 40:28.890
You...

40:29.860 --> 40:31.040
Did you wash your shirt again?

40:31.690 --> 40:33.050
Did you scrub it on a washboard?

40:33.980 --> 40:35.460
If you keep washing it like this,

40:35.460 --> 40:37.380
this shirt of yours
will have a huge hole again,

40:37.380 --> 40:38.650
just like your previous shirt.

40:39.426 --> 40:40.900
If so, you should show me an example.

40:40.960 --> 40:42.460
I'll learn it from you some other day.

40:44.620 --> 40:46.170
♪Will receive the most♪

40:46.170 --> 40:48.690
How did you wash your clothes when
you were in the countryside?

40:49.570 --> 40:50.460
I don't remember.

40:50.515 --> 40:52.460
Perhaps some other girls
washed them for me.

40:52.570 --> 40:53.940
Stop bragging.

40:53.940 --> 40:55.300
Anyway, I won't do your laundry.

40:55.380 --> 40:56.340
I'll do yours, then.

40:56.340 --> 40:57.090
No need.

40:57.090 --> 40:58.380
You might ruin my clothes.

40:59.860 --> 41:00.940
Who knows for sure?

41:02.380 --> 41:04.340
How did your training go?

41:04.493 --> 41:07.160
They said that I could draw comic strips
for the magazine firm

41:07.380 --> 41:09.170
after I completed the training.

41:09.360 --> 41:10.490
And, I'll get paid for it.

41:12.090 --> 41:12.900
That's great.

41:13.690 --> 41:14.490
What's great?

41:16.740 --> 41:18.010
Everything's great.

41:33.780 --> 41:35.260
Alright, you may stop here.

41:38.340 --> 41:40.090
Regarding our fake marriage,

41:40.090 --> 41:41.780
we must keep it from my parents.

41:41.780 --> 41:42.810
They'll never agree to it.

41:42.871 --> 41:45.340
It'll be troublesome
if the unit allocation gets delayed.

41:45.404 --> 41:47.204
Let's acquire
our marriage certificate first.

41:47.204 --> 41:49.280
They can't do anything about it
even if they find out.

41:49.900 --> 41:51.570
But can we actually hide this from them?

41:51.740 --> 41:53.090
We should do it first.

41:53.380 --> 41:55.570
Take this bicycle with you tonight.

41:55.650 --> 41:58.780
Go to the Educated Youth Office tomorrow
morning to get a letter of introduction.

41:58.780 --> 42:00.530
I'll get one too.

42:00.530 --> 42:01.940
Let's proceed with the procedure.

42:01.940 --> 42:03.740
We'll be fine once we receive the unit.

42:03.740 --> 42:04.320
Understood.

42:04.471 --> 42:06.471
I wish to live with you
as soon as possible too.

42:07.780 --> 42:08.710
No.

42:09.050 --> 42:10.740
That's not what I mean.

42:10.780 --> 42:12.980
I mean, I don't want any
additional trouble to crop up.

42:12.980 --> 42:14.460
It'll be troublesome if Ms. Xu

42:14.460 --> 42:15.693
goes back on her word again.

42:15.715 --> 42:16.460
Understood.

42:18.340 --> 42:20.650
Alright now. It's getting late.

42:20.780 --> 42:22.090
You should head back now.

42:22.582 --> 42:23.690
You should head back first.

42:23.782 --> 42:25.050
I'll leave once you're inside.

42:25.260 --> 42:26.130
I'm already an adult.

42:26.130 --> 42:26.980
You should leave now.

42:32.300 --> 42:32.780
Go now.

42:38.780 --> 42:40.610
See you at the hospital
tomorrow morning.

42:41.010 --> 42:41.340
Okay.

43:07.530 --> 43:08.680
You're going to get married?

43:11.860 --> 43:12.650
To whom?

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
